# Shared ignore file for `vercel --prod` run from the repository root.
#
# Both Vercel projects (backend, frontend) use a Root Directory inside this
# repo, so they are both deployed from here. Only the project-specific root
# directory is needed for each build; everything else is dropped to keep the
# upload small (the repo is ~1 GB, mostly frontend/node_modules and
# 3DQRGenerator/build).

3DQRGenerator/
engine/
scripts/

patch.js
backend.Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
README.md

frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.next/
frontend/.vercel/
frontend/coverage/

# Never upload local secrets or build artefacts.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.pyc